    <Label Name="Title" Style="GalleryTitle" Text="Magic Tree" Pin="TopRight" OffsetX="16" OffsetY="16" WrapWidth="400" Backdrop="true" />
    <Label Name="Description" Style="GalleryText" Text="Every branch of this tree splits in two, and each new pair copies the first fork: it turns and shrinks the same way.\n\nDrag the owl, the bird and the chick to change the first fork, and the whole tree grows again: tall and thin, wide like an umbrella, or curled up like a fern.\n\nThe trunk splits six times, so there are 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 = 64 fruits. Count them!" Pin="TopRight" OffsetX="16" OffsetY="64" WrapWidth="400" Backdrop="true" />
  </Figures>
